OL,3,GNEWSAHydrofoil could provide link to
OL,4,AScilly, says firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FA marine technology firm has been
OL,7,Fshowcasing an all-weather electric
OL,8,Fhydrofoil vessel it says could travel
OL,9,Fbetween Cornwall and the Isles of
OL,10,FScilly.
OL,12,FArtemis Technologies said the
OL,13,Fhydrofoil, which uses underwater wings
OL,14,Fto lift the boat out of the water,
OL,15,Fcould operate in winter when seas are
OL,16,Fchoppy.
OL,18,FJohn Patterson, from the firm, said
OL,19,Fsaid four days of demonstrations in
OL,20,FNewlyn and St Mary's were "really
OL,21,Fexciting" for the region.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
