OL,3,GNEWSAHydrofoil could provide link to
OL,4,AScilly, says firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey follow a feasibility study run
OL,7,Fwith the Council of the Isles of Scilly
OL,8,Fto see if the technology "could help
OL,9,Fmake life easier for the locals" with
OL,10,F"quick, clean, efficient transit".
